    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11337" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cortōna</span></b> , ae,
		f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				very ancient town in Etruria, northwest of Lake Trasimenus</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Liv.
				9, 37, 12</span></i>; <i><span class="en">22,
				4, 1</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
