				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">montes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					22, 4, 2</span></i>
			.—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cortōnenses</span></b> , <i>its
			inhabitants</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5, 8, §
		52</span></i>.</div>
